supabase/.temp/

# Private source material (client usernames, unpublished attribution notes) — never commit.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored "internal/" would also silently
# swallow api/internal/ (the payment-verified/set-fit endpoints), which is
# real, meant-to-ship code, not private notes — caught while building the
# offer system (2026-09-28).
/internal/

# Build caches
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local-only material that must never be committed: raw/large media, review drafts, working notes.
# (GitHub rejects files over 100 MB, and public/ is served to the world.)
/review/
/scratchpad/
/*.zip
/.videopackage.mjs
/public/videos/featured_film/
.vercel
.env*
